        24,
        361.8,
        571.0,
        424.0
       ]
      }
     ],
     "rawText": "Find the acute angle between the two vectors A = 2ax + ay + 3az and B = ax − 3ay + 2az by using\nthe definition of (i) the dot product; (ii) the cross product.",
