     "rawText": "A uniform plane electromagnetic wave operates at a frequency f = 600 MHz and is propagating in a\nlossless dielectric medium with:\nRelative permittivity εr = 4, Relative permeability µr = 9.\nGiven:\nPermittivity of free space: ε0 =8.854×10-12F/m\nPermeability of free space: µo = 4π ×10-7 H/m\nAssume maximum electric field amplitude E0 = 200 V/m, polarized along x-axis, and propagation in\n+z-direction.\nFind:\ni) The propagation constant ß.\nii) The wavelength λ.\niii) The equations of E(z, t) and H(z,t) fields.",
